{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "PRO",
  "chapter": 8,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Doth not wisdom cry,\nAnd understanding put forth her voice?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "On the top of high places by the way,\nWhere the paths meet, she standeth;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Beside the gates, at the entry of the city,\nAt the coming in at the doors, she crieth aloud:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Unto you, O men, I call;\nAnd my voice is to the sons of men.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O ye simple, understand prudence;\nAnd, ye fools, be of an understanding heart.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hear, for I will speak excellent things;\nAnd the opening of my lips shall be right things.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For my mouth shall utter truth;\nAnd wickedness is an abomination to my lips.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "All the words of my mouth are in righteousness;\nThere is nothing crooked or perverse in them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They are all plain to him that understandeth,\nAnd right to them that find knowledge.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Receive my instruction, and not silver;\nAnd knowledge rather than choice gold.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For wisdom is better than rubies;\nAnd all the things that may be desired are not to be compared unto it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I wisdom have made prudence my dwelling,\nAnd find out knowledge ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " discretion.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The fear of Jehovah is to hate evil:\nPride, and arrogancy, and the evil way,\nAnd the perverse mouth, do I hate.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Counsel is mine, and sound knowledge:\nI am understanding; I have might.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "By me kings reign,\nAnd princes decree justice.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "By me princes rule,\nAnd nobles, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " all the judges of the earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I love them that love me;\nAnd those that seek me diligently shall find me.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Riches and honor are with me;",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "Yea",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", durable wealth and righteousness.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My fruit is better than gold, yea, than fine gold;\nAnd my revenue than choice silver.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I walk in the way of righteousness,\nIn the midst of the paths of justice;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That I may cause those that love me to inherit substance,\nAnd that I may fill their treasuries.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jehovah possessed me in the beginning of his way,Before his works of old.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I was set up from everlasting, from the beginning,\nBefore the earth was.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When there were no depths, I was brought forth,\nWhen there were no fountains abounding with water.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Before the mountains were settled,\nBefore the hills was I brought forth;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "While as yet he had not made the earth, nor the fields,\nNor the beginning of the dust of the world.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When he established the heavens, I was there:\nWhen he set a circle upon the face of the deep,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When he made firm the skies above,\nWhen the fountains of the deep became strong,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When he gave to the sea its bound,\nThat the waters should not transgress his commandment,\nWhen he marked out the foundations of the earth;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then I was by him, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "as",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a master workman;\nAnd I was daily ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " delight,Rejoicing always before him,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Rejoicing in his habitable earth;\nAnd my delight was with the sons of men.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now therefore, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "my",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " sons, hearken unto me;\nFor blessed are they that keep my ways.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Hear instruction, and be wise,\nAnd refuse it not.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.34",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.34",
      "verse": 34,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Blessed is the man that heareth me,\nWatching daily at my gates,\nWaiting at the posts of my doors.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.35",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.35",
      "verse": 35,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For whoso findeth me findeth life,\nAnd shall obtain favor of Jehovah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PRO.8.36",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:PRO.8.36",
      "verse": 36,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But he that sinneth against me wrongeth his own soul:\nAll they that hate me love death.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    }
  ]
}
